  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.17>asatruLessonIntro-&gt; 聆听奥丁,全能之父从乌尔德之井低语所说的话:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.17>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.18>asatruLessonIntro-&gt;Lo, Völuspá的诗句向所有愿意聆听的人宣布:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.18>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.19>asatruLessonIntro-&gt; 在雷神的锤子被击中时注意它,因为它教导:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.19>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.20>asatruLessonIntro-&gt; Hark,乌鸦胡金和穆宁圈并哭出他们的真理来:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.20>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.21>asatruLessonIntro-&gt; 在伊格德拉西尔的阴影下,众神确实聚集并宣布:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.21>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.22>asatruLessonIntro-&gt;B 以巴尔德所赐之光,知道这一点:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.22>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.23>asatruLessonIntro-&gt; 关于&quot;九大世界&quot;的峡湾,智慧回响,说:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.23>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.24>asatruLessonIntro-&gt; 刻入米德加德石块的遗迹这样教导我们:</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.24>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.25>asatruLessonReinforcement-&gt;愿你们的行为在瓦尔哈拉的大厅中回响。</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.25>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.26>asatruLessonReinforcement-&gt;. 诺斯人用荣耀的线织出你的命运.</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.26>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.27>asatruLessonReinforcement-&gt;Stand Stand complete, 为众神奖励勇气和决心.</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.27>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.28>asatruLessonReinforcement-&gt;Hail, 由於您所做的事会激发人们的歌声。</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.28>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.29>asatruLessonReinforcement-&gt;. 托尔之锤为那些坚持真理和力量的人祝福.</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.29>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.30>asatruLessonReinforcement-&gt;. 全能父亲看那些尊重老道的人.</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.30>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.31>asatruLessonReinforcement-&gt; 愿您在亲属关系的神圣纽带中找到胜利。</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.31>
  <VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.32>lessonReinforcement-&gt; 所以这个故事会继续发展下去。</VFEM2_Structure_Norse_Description.rules.rulesStrings.32>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.0>intro-&gt;[introprefix], [introsuffix] 单位 [place_name],则 [place_adjective] 和解和 [place_summary]幸存者找到一个脆弱的立足点。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.0>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.1>introprefix-&gt; 炸弹倒下后旧世界倒塌后</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.1>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.10>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 星辰号跟踪他们的定居点,迫使绝望地在已知的边界以外进行寻回.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.10>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.11>crisis(uses=2)-&gt;Radiation风暴横扫了土地,毒害了地和心,考验了他们的决心。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.11>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.12>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 潜伏于黑暗中的被混入了魔兽和扭曲的恐怖,威胁了每一个步骤.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.12>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.13>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 内部冲突使他们的团结受到破坏,因为幸存者中恐惧和怀疑日增。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.13>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.14>crisis(uses=2)-&gt;昔日战争的鬼魂在被摧毁的城市中呼应 敌对派别争夺权力的崩溃 [place_powerCenter].</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.14>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.15>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 由辐射和污秽所生出的各种瓦斯泰兰疾病横扫了整个社区,声称年轻人和老人一样,看不到治愈方法。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.15>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.16>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 不稳定水源干涸或被下毒,迫使去遥远,未知的绿洲进行危险的行走.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.16>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.17>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 天空被灰和火暴所烧,将太阳抹去并冷却出地至骨深的寒冷.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.17>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.18>crisis(uses=2)-&gt;Rival 战带发动了无情的突袭,夷平了农场和村庄,分散了家庭并粉碎了脆弱的联盟.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.18>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.19>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 世界老技术动摇和崩溃,使幸存者从废品中拼凑出武器和工具,往往面临极大的风险。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.19>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.2>introprefix-&gt; 核火后 核火后</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.2>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.20>crisis(uses=2)-&gt; 一种潜伏的、非自然的威胁的口音——被科学所扭曲的变种人疯狂地在人民中散布出恐怖和妄想。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.20>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.21>response-&gt;[responseprefix], [responsesuffix] 环绕中心,如 [place_community],则 [place_adjective] 人民聚集在一起,包括 [place_job]他保持了脆弱的和平。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.21>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.22>responseprefix-&gt; 有人转而走老路</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.22>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.23>responseprefix-&gt;. 领军者崛起-军阀.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.23>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.24>responseprefix-&gt; 他们与周边团体结成了脆弱的联盟</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.24>
