  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.3>introprefix-&gt; 大战留下了比沙漠和废墟更深的伤疤</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.3>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.30>responsesuffix-&gt; 贸易知识,武器,和希望.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.30>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.31>responsesuffix-&gt;先出手并毫不留情地对敌人施以怜悯.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.31>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.32>responsesuffix-&gt;offering 混乱中的意义.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.32>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.33>responsesuffix-&gt; 来保卫并维持他们的家园.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.33>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.34>transformation-&gt;[transformationprefix], [transformationsuffix] 他们的大厅,像 [place_powerCenter]成为混乱中秩序的象征</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.34>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.35>transformationprefix-&gt; 随着时间的推移,他们的习俗被强化为法律</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.35>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.36>transformationprefix-&gt;. 最初,随着分散的幸存者成长为一支强大的力量。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.36>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.37>transformationprefix-&gt; 他们的旗帜在战场和议会大厅上都升起</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.37>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.38>transformationprefix-&gt;. 一些古城被废墟所平息</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.38>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.39>transformationprefix-&gt; 艰苦的伤痕给他们留下了烙印</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.39>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.4>introprefix-&gt; 当文明倒下时</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.4>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.40>transformationprefix-&gt; 领导者周围成长</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.40>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.41>transformationsuffix-&gt; 相会,并不可破誓.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.41>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.42>transformationsuffix-&gt; 恐惧并尊重废物。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.42>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.43>transformationsuffix-&gt; 团结与权力的同名词.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.43>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.44>transformationsuffix-&gt; 将衰变为希望堡垒.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.44>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.45>transformationsuffix-&gt; 造就了一个永远不会屈从于墙外恐怖的民族.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.45>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.46>transformationsuffix-&gt;tales 被火光所启示,启发后世.</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.46>
