  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.48>legacyprefix-&gt; 现在</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.48>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.49>legacyprefix-&gt; 从破碎的起步</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.49>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.5>introsuffix-&gt; 被辐射废物所活活的幸存者。</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.5>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.50>legacyprefix-&gt; 他们的故事是抗御力的故事</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.50>
  <Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.51>legacyprefix-&gt; 尽管废物很严酷</Greenway_IdeoStoryPattern_General.rules.rulesStrings.51>
